    "title": "ArtsBuild Opens Artists Work Grants To Provide Public Art Experiences - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Christina Sacco ,\n20 hours ago ArtsBuild is proud to announce that applications are now open for the Artists Work Grant program. This initiative provides vital project funding to individual artists and non-profit arts organizations to create public artworks that animate the diverse spaces of Hamilton County. The program is currently seeking applications through April 30, 2026. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
